        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Want to stay on top of the science and politics driving biotech today?&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/signup/readout/\">Sign up</a>&#xa0;to get our biotech newsletter in your inbox.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning. We got big news on the FDA last night &#x2014; let&#x2019;s get straight into it.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-white-house-pulls-nomination-of-overton-to-lead-fda\">White House pulls nomination of Overton to lead FDA</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Trump administration is pulling its nomination of Heidi Overton to be FDA commissioner, my colleagues report.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/18/biotech-news-fda-discloses-reasons-for-rejecting-summit-drug/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
